stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Recovery
    lg1: Session
    lg2: Breaks BoundOwnSource in some cases
    lg3: Path to the BoundOwnSource bug
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 mayBreak
  class lg3 bugPath
  s0: No session
  s1: No session, a message waiting
  s2: Creating, a message waiting
  s3: Created, location not yet recorded, a message waiting
  s4: Pane recorded, only a shell, a message waiting
  s5: Pane recorded, provider up, no prompt yet, a message waiting
  s6: First prompt sent, waiting for its hook
  s7: First prompt taken, its source logged, not bound, a message waiting
  s8: Pane recorded, pane gone, host server down, a message waiting
  s9: No session, host server down, a message waiting
  s10: No session, host server replaced, a message waiting
  s11: Creating, host server replaced, a message waiting
  s12: Created, location not yet recorded, host server replaced, a message waiting
  s13: Pane recorded, only a shell, host server replaced, a message waiting
  s14: Pane recorded, provider up, no prompt yet, host server replaced, a message waiting
  s15: First prompt sent, waiting for its hook, host server replaced (no more messages)
  s16: dcserver down, provider still running, host server replaced (no more messages)
  s17: Boot reconcile, host server replaced (after the restart) (no more messages)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a message arrives
  s1 --> s2: a message reserves a new execution
  s2 --> s3: the host creates it
  s3 --> s4: its pane is recorded
  s4 --> s5: the provider starts in the pane
  s5 --> s6: the turn sends Codex its first prompt
  s6 --> s6: a message arrives
  s6 --> s7: Codex's first hook arrives
  s7 --> s7: a host probe stops failing
  s7 --> s8: the host server ends
  s8 --> s9: the recorded pane is gone: row closed
  s9 --> s10: the host server starts again
  s10 --> s11: a message reserves a new execution
  s11 --> s12: the host creates it
  s12 --> s13: its pane is recorded
  s13 --> s14: the provider starts in the pane
  s14 --> s15: the turn sends Codex its first prompt
  s15 --> s16: dcserver stops
  s16 --> s17: dcserver starts
  s17 --> s17: the restart restores its listing, provider mapping, placeholder and binding or the recorded pane's provider is adopted
